Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 23:57:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ICE increment 4b: remove profile-stored ICE UI + old server
 ICE card

- profile page: drop the blood type, emergency contact, and server ICE-card sections; link to the client-side /ice-card instead; stop reading ice_token
